          "text": "YÜ Huai 余懷 (T. 澹心, 無懷, 曼持, 曼翁, 廣霞), Aug. 25, 1616–1696, July, poet, was a native of P'u-t'ien, Fukien. When the Manchu troops advanced to Nanking in 1645 he was a student of the Imperial Academy in that city.",
